  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Culinary background class feature</p>\n<p>Your cooking skills run tall rather than wide, focusing on perfecting what you do know rather than picking up new tricks.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Choose a major culinary skillset that you know. Add +1 to the Difficulty Class for all saving throws against abilities from the chosen major culinary skillset.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> You can gain Culinary Focus twice. Taken a second time, it applies to your other major culinary skillset.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/herbalism-feats#toc3\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
